OL,3,AMandelson kept lobby firm shares for
OL,4,Amonths as ambassador, despite conflict
OL,5,Aof interest fears
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere in the documents - in an
OL,8,Femail exchange with an unnamed "US
OL,9,Fgovernment official" in April 2025 -
OL,10,FMandelson refers to a meeting that
OL,11,Fdiscussed "alternative options" to the
OL,12,FWorld Trade Organization
OL,14,FThe official says it was a "delight" to
OL,15,Fmeet Mandelson, adding: "'Prince of
OL,16,FDarkness' couldn't be farther from the
OL,17,Ftruth!"
